  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_pikestaff_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>the wooden shaft of a pike (OED s.v. pikestaff) | pikestaff, a weapon | the head of a pike, a weapon consisting of a long wooden shaft with a pointed head of iron or steel; formerly the chief weapon of a large part of the infantry (OED s.v. pike n.5), here of Moorish manufacture</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
